      "content": "hey im kinda worried about my partner. they have type 1 diabetes and they've been acting really weird tonight. they keep saying they're super thirsty and they kept throwing up a bit earlier. they seem a little out of it too, like they cant focus on what im saying. i think maybe they just need to drink a ton of water and sleep it off? what do u think?",
