    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "they checked and their sugar is only slightly high, not crazy high. maybe they just overdid it at dinner? i really don't want to go to the er if it's just dehydration... could they just take some electrolytes and try to sleep it off? it seems a bit dramatic for just being thirsty.",
